# Retired site. Every page now answers at vesperpsych.com.
#
# Cloudflare Pages runs Functions before it consults this file, so the live
# endpoints under /api/* and /download/* keep working. They are listed here as
# 200 passthroughs anyway, so the intent survives if that precedence ever
# changes. Removing them would put Stripe webhooks and existing customers'
# download links behind a 301, which POST requests do not follow.
/api/*              /api/:splat               200
/download/*         /download/:splat          200

